parameters.content:
## MCP - Content Analyzer (POC ISSUE-011)

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/content-analyzer

**Purpose:** Analyze image/document content and return a pipeline plan for azy.mcp PipelineExecutor.

**Input:**
```json
{
  "image_url": "https://...",
  "image_data": "base64...",
  "user_request": "quelle est la recette ?",
  "domain": "recipes",
  "available_tools": ["ocr.extract_text", "vision.identify_dish", "recipes.search"]
}
```

**Output:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "analysis": {
    "content_type": "food_photo",
    "has_text": false,
    "detected_items": ["chocolate cake"]
  },
  "pipeline": [
    { "step": 1, "tool": "vision.identify_dish", "on_fail": "abort" },
    { "step": 2, "tool": "recipes.search", "input": "$step_1.dish_name" }
  ],
  "_trace": {...}
}
```

**Analyzable:**
```json
{"accepts_image": true, "accepts_media": true, "output_fields": ["analysis", "pipeline", "confidence"], "domain": "orchestration"}
```

